Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:36.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟上他们 跟上酷冰侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow them, follow Frozone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,鲍勃 帮我搞定那个锅炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob! Help me with the boiler!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样就没问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:12.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在这干什么 还不赶快出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you kids doing? Get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.98,0:08:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就要爆炸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's gonna blow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:16.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:29.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许动 超人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze, Supers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:33.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 我们又怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what did we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:40.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,打扰一下 您是 酷冰侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Mr. Zone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:45.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我出现在这违法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, but I'm not really supposed to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:47.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,这太不公平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which seems wrong...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:52.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你有这个兴趣 改变法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you'd be interested in changing that law?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:55.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,几位超人 包括酷冰侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superheroes including Frozone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:57.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,超能先生 和弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Incredible, and Elastigirl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:59.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,对城市建筑造成很大破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}caused further damage to the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,暗中破坏王仍然逍遥法外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Underminer remains at large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:03.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,先动手的又不是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't start this fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:05.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们也没有阻止他啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you didn't finish it either!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.17,0:09:07.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们阻止暗中破坏王破坏城市了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you stop the Underminer from inflicting more damage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:09.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们成功阻止他们抢银行了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you stop him from robbing the banks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:11.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 你们抓住他了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Did you catch him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 银行都有保险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - The banks were insured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,那突发情况我们也有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have infrastructure in place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.11,0:09:16.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,相应的基础措施进行应对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to deal with these matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.35,0:09:18.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是这次你们没有乱插手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you had simply done nothing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.15,0:09:19.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都会顺畅无阻的解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything would now be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:21.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会有麻烦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}proceeding in an orderly fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道你想让我们什么都不做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd have preferred we do nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:25.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,最好袖手旁观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without a doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:30.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也不帮我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't much help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不想别人坑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want out of the hole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:36.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,就别自己先往坑里跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First you gotta put down the shovel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:41.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,这算哪门子事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that went poorly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 我知道你今天不开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, this is probably{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:47.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不该给你添堵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not the best time to tell you about this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.25,0:09:50.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 今天还有一件别的事 有个同学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but something else happened today with a kid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:53.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到了我摘了面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:08.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 对了 迪瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey, Rick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,小倩的一个朋友 一个叫托尼的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violet thinks a friend of hers, a kid named Tony...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:13.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能看到她是超人了 当时她没带面具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}might have seen her in the outfit, without her mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他是大嘴巴么 - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Talkative type? - Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只知道他姓莱丁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last name is Rydinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:19.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尼·莱丁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony Rydinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:21.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去找找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,鲍勃 何莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob, Helen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:25.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还有句话要说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a word if you don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:28.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,超人援助项目遭到中止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, the program's been shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.59,0:10:31.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些政客永远不能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Politicians don't understand people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:34.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人做好事只是因为他们想伸张正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who do good simply because it's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:36.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞得那些政客很紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes 'em nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:39.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,多年来他们一直想抓超人的把柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been gunning for Supers for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天让他们抓了个正着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today was all they needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:43.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,总而言之\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.47,0:10:45.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要走人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:47.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只能在帮你们再多交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid two more weeks in the motel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:48.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,两个星期的汽车旅馆住宿费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the best I can do for ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:49.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,帮不上太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为我们做的够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done plenty, Rick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:52.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不会忘记的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:54.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,很荣幸能和你们这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it has been a great honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:56.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,善良的人一起工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}working with you good people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切 祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for everything, and good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:01.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:17.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚才洗手了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you wash your hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:21.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该用肥皂洗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With soap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.55,0:11:24.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你擦手了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you dry them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:33.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么 里面怎么都是难吃的蔬菜 哪个讨厌鬼点这么多菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Is this all vegetables? Who ordered all vegetables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:35.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我点的 多吃蔬菜有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did. They're good and you're going to have some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:39.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们难道就不提这事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we going to talk about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:41.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么事 - 大家都装看不见的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - The elephant in the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么看不见的事 - 那我还是不要提了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What elephant? - I guess not then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:45.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你指的是今天的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're referring to today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.17,0:11:46.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 今天到底是什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, what's the deal with today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:48.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都会犯错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all made mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,举个例子来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For example,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:51.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们两个今天应该照顾小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you kids were supposed to watch Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:54.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们去看孩子 你们俩打击犯罪拯救城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babysitting, while you guys did the important stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:56.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We talked about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们年纪太小还不能做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not old enough to decide about these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我们多少能帮上点忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are old enough to help out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:00.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:01.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是你说的吗 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that what you tell us, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:05.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 这个 帮忙也可以有很多种形式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, "help out" can mean many different things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们有麻烦我们就应该帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're supposed to help, if there's trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.96,0:12:08.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对 也对 - 你们难道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, yeah, but... - Aren't you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不为我们今天帮忙而高兴吗 - 我很高兴 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- glad we helped today? - Yeah, I know but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说过为我们感到骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that you were proud of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:13.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说了是骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah, I was. Am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:14.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们也要去教训坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wanna fight bad guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:17.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 你们不许去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.44,0:12:19.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说过情况已经不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said things were different now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:22.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,的确不一样 那可是在岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they were, on the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:23.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可没有说你们现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I didn't mean that from now on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:26.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我们以后永远不能使用超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now, we've gotta go back to never using our powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:27.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,这会影响我的人生观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It defines who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没说你们不能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not saying you have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:31.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 电视里就是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Someone on TV said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:33.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,能不能先吃饭 先别吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we just eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:36.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,饭都快凉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dinner, while it's hot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:37.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们今天做错事了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we do something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:39.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.10,0:12:41.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们今天做的不是错事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't do anything wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,使用超能力还是违法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superheroes are illegal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管公不公平 这就是法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether it's fair or not, that's the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:48.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,法律就应该公平 不然我们怎么教育孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The law should be fair. What are we teaching our kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.71,0:12:50.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫他们怎么尊重法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To respect the law!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是那法律是不公平的 不值得尊重的 怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even when the law is disrespectful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:54.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,法律不公平也通过法律来修正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If laws are unjust, there are laws to change them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:55.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,不然一切都乱套了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, it's chaos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:57.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们生活就已经乱套了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is exactly what we have!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是觉得 只有那样才酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought it was kinda cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:09.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哪样才酷 - 与家人一起 去打击犯罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was? - Fighting crime as a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:12.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是很酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:15.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,但也过去了 世界就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's over. The world is what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:18.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必需要适应世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to adapt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:19.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界是不是很糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are things bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界很正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:23.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能走了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I be excused?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:30.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还要在汽车旅馆住到什么时候呀爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer in the motel, Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:33.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 呃... - 不会太久了宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh... - Not much longer, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:42.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,以后该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:44.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:45.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许迪瑞克还会帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Dicker will find something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不会再帮我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dicker is done, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:50.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们想要再一次成为超人 根本就是幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any thought we had about being Supers again is fantasy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们中至少得有一个人找份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of us has gotta get a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:53.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,找份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:55.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在安心保险干了很多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did a long stint at Insuricare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:57.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,每一分钟都会是煎熬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hated every minute of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.14,0:13:58.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这样你很痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it was hard on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:00.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我去找份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's my turn in the private sector{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你留在家里照顾孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you take care of the kids...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:05.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 还是我去吧 我必须要工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm doing this. I need to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:07.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的西服和领带你放哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where my suit and ties are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:09.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞机砸中了我们房子的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burned up when...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,都烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The jet destroyed our house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:12.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:15.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在不能依靠任何人的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't count on anyone else now, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.26,0:14:16.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,只能靠自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:17.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能等着别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't wait for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人护着咱们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No lifeguard on duty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:30.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,得自力更生咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swim at your own risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:31.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你今天又跑哪去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, where'd you go today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:33.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么不跟我们去喝茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I noticed you missed all the fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,别生气 因为我知道什么是优雅退场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be mad because I know when to leave a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:38.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我和你们一样违反了法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just as illegal as you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:41.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,另外 我还知道警察会放了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I knew the cops would let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:42.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 鲍勃还想多住两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, in spite of Bob's best efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:44.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,是 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:47.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说援助项目停了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard the program shut down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在旅馆里还能住多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer are you in this motel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,两个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:52.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了 你说了我可以帮你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you know the offer still stands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的好意 可我们家有五口人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very generous, but there are five of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.51,0:14:56.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能跑去给你们添麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wouldn't do that to you and Honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:57.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 随时欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, door's always open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:15:00.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过今天不光只有坏消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the news isn't all bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:02.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在警察局里喝茶的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you guys were being detained...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:06.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,有个人来找我 他可是大财团的代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was approached by a dude who represents this tycoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:08.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 文斯顿·迪沃 - 他想找我谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Winston Deavor. - Wants to talk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:12.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有你们两个 谈谈超能力的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with me, with you two, about hero stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我查过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I checked him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:14.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很守法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's legit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,是迪瑞克的学生 他想见我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trained under Dicker. He wants to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:18.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 天哪 又是超能力惹来的麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, jeez! More superhero trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们今天刚从警察局里出来鲁修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just came from the police station, Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:24.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么时候去 - 今天晚上 我现在就过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When? - Tonight. I'm going there now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.54,0:15:26.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你一路顺风 我们就不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You enjoy, I'm sitting this one out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:27.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他想叫我们三个一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants all three of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:31.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们起码先去听听他要说些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, let's just at least hear what he has to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:34.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,地址在名片上 我们一会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the address, I'll meet you guys there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:36.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还得穿超能装去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go in our Supersuits?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.65,0:15:38.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:40.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许还是穿旧式超能装比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might wanna wear the old Supersuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.55,0:15:43.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉那个人挺怀旧的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a feeling he's nostalgic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们两个要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:51.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天晚上外面的空气特别的新鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fresh air is especially good tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.57,0:15:52.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是小杰醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Jack-Jack wakes up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.83,0:15:54.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:07.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你们的识别牌 请走这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your security badges. Please, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 对了 我是您的头号粉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen, you're my biggest fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.45,0:16:10.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:13.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的 我是您的头号粉丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your biggest fan. Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:40.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 最爱超级英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love superheroes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,强大的超能力 超能装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The powers, the costumes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:44.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有华丽的战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the mythic struggles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是文斯顿·迪沃 可以叫我阿文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winston Deavor. You can call me Win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:47.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常高兴能见到各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genuine pleasure to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:49.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 酷冰侠 - 我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Frozone! - It's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:50.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 弹力女超人 - 见到你很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Elastigirl. - Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:52.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还有超能先生 - 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Incredible! - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:16.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我简直无法用言语表达我内心的兴奋 这位是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't tell you what a thrill this is. And this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:20.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家好各位超人们 真的非常抱歉我迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hello there, superheroes. I'm so sorry I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我拖拖拉拉的妹妹 伊芙琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is my tardy sister, Evelyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:26.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的确拖拉 我先自责 你不用这么指责我好吗 文斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm scolding myself so you don't have to, Winston!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spectacular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:30.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲一定非常自豪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was so proud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:33.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能和各位超人有一星半点的联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I was even remotely connected to you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:35.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,他管你们叫 正义的最后一道防线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to call you the last line of defense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,他最支持超能力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was your top supporter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:40.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,他出钱支持超人事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He donated to superhero causes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.35,0:17:41.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,还筹资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He raised money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,修建了市中心公园的傲魄侠雕像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the Dynaguy statue in Avery Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:45.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,他认识不少超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got to know many Supers personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.52,0:17:47.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至家里还安装了电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even installed a phone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:50.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,紧急情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with direct lines to Gazerbeam and Fironic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.39,0:17:51.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,能直接打给电光眼和长枪侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in case of emergencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:54.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,他可高兴了 天天对人炫耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He loved that, showed it off to everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:55.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们被迫停止活动的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was heartbroken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:57.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,他真的很伤心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you were all forced to go underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,父亲相信世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father believed the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:00.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果少了超人的保护会更危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would become more dangerous without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:04.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,没想到他的话成真了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't know how right he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:06.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,家里进了贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a break-in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.64,0:18:11.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲马上打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father called Gazerbeam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:12.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,直接向电光眼求助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The direct line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.65,0:18:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:17.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,他又打给长枪侠 也没有人接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He called Fironic, no answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:20.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,当时刚刚宣布禁止使用超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superheroes had just been made illegal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:22.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,父亲就在电话旁边被强盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The robbers discovered him on the phone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:23.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,开枪杀害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and shot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:27.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:29.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们一定很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must've been hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:30.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,母亲尤其难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially for Mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:33.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,几个月后母亲伤心过度 也过世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died a few months later. Heartbreak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:36.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果超人没有被迫隐藏身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If superheroes had not been forced underground...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:38.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许父亲也不会被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it never would've happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:40.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者父亲可以一听到强盗进屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or Dad could've taken Mom to the safe room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:41.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,就带着妈妈躲进安全屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as soon as he knew there was trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我绝对不能同意这种说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I disagree strongly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过现在还是不要讨论这个问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're not going into it right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:47.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,重点是当时没人相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:49.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会顺利接手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nobody expected us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续经营父亲的公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be able to actually run Dad's company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:55.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 伊芙琳是设计师 我又擅长经商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with Evelyn as designer, and myself as operator...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:58.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们夜以继日的工作 迪沃科技才不断发展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}uh, we threw ourselves into building DEVTECH{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:59.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,有了今天的成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into what it is today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:02.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是世界上数一数二的大型电信公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A world-class telecommunications company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:03.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,规模非常大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bigger than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:07.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,大企业就更要负起责任 支持正义的事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly positioned to make some wrong things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:08.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我们见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hence, this meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我先问一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,说说你们被迫停止活动的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the main reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:13.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,真正原因是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were all forced underground?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 因为人们的无知 - 其实是印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ignorance. - Perception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:18.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,就拿暗中破坏王的事来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take today for example, with the Underminer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.58,0:19:20.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,情况非常危急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Difficult situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:22.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们需要迅速做出许多艰难的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were faced with a lot of hard decisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.42,0:19:23.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错 继续说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, tell me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:24.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我不知道这个过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我并没有亲眼看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I didn't see it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:29.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他人也看不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}neither did anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:31.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以 你们今天奋力和坏人搏斗的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, when you fight bad guys like today...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:34.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们既看不到战斗也不知道前因后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people don't see the fight or what led up to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:36.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们只能看到政客想让他们看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They see what politicians tell them to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:39.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们看到了破坏 又看到了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They see destruction and they see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么 如果我们想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if we wanna change{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.04,0:19:43.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,彻底改变公众的对超级英雄过时的印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people's perceptions about superheroes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:44.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,就需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:47.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们与世界分享你们独有的超级视角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to share your perceptions with the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.18,0:19:49.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 具体应该怎么做呢 - 用镜头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do we do that? - With cameras.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:53.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要把超人的视角分享给全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you to share your perceptions with the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:54.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:57.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会在你们穿的超能装里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We embed tiny cameras, like those,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,安装微型摄像头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into your Supersuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:19:59.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇哦 真小巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, so small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.69,0:20:01.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是画质非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the picture is outstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 是我亲自设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks! Designed 'em myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有资源 有活动家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got resources, lobbyists,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:05.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,在全世界都有非常广泛的人脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}worldwide connections...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:08.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有最重要的 就是保险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and very important, insurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:09.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,保险才是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insurance is key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.77,0:20:12.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在缺的就是最厉害的超人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we need now are the super-est superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:14.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,也就是你们三位 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It needs you three. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:18.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,加入我们 努力让超能力再次合法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me make all Supers legal again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.01,0:20:19.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,这真是太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This sounds great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.12,0:20:21.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就开始吧 我的任务是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this going. What's my first assignment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,超能先生 你这种热情非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That enthusiasm is golden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:25.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,请保持住 其实我们要想改变超人形象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now hold on to it. But for our first move...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:29.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,重点在弹力女超人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Elastigirl is our best play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.69,0:20:32.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道 她比我更强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:34.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说 她很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, she's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:36.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,她真的很有能力 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, a credit to her...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.83,0:20:39.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你懂得 你懂我意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know. You know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很尊重您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With great respect...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过您还是不要太依赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's not test the whole{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:43.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,保险反正都可以理赔 这种想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"insurance-will-pay- for-everything" idea...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.91,0:20:46.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,特别是一开始的时候好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the first go 'round, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.11,0:20:49.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下 你是什么意思 我能力不太行么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. You're saying what? I'm messy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,是这样 伊芙琳作了成本收益分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Evelyn did a cost-benefit analysis...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:54.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,比较了你们停止活动之前五年间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}comparing all your last five years of crime fighting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.22,0:20:55.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们打击犯罪情况的数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before going underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:57.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人的数据是最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Elastigirl's numbers are self-explanatory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:20:59.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,这种比较根本就不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not a fair comparison!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.96,0:21:02.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 重要的问题就得用重量级的解决办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavyweight problems need heavyweight solutions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:04.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,说的对 最终所有的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course! We're gonna solve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:06.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都要解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all kinds of problems together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:11.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 在此之前要来一次完美的公关 重点推出弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the perfect launch with Elastigirl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:14.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么 你怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你问我怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:19.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:21.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么可能不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, you don't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:23.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,几个小时前 你还说超能力的时代已经过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few hours ago, you were saying it was over...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:26.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,当超人只是幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and being a superhero was a fantasy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:28.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,可现在改变人生的好机会来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you get the offer of a lifetime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.19,0:21:29.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你居然说你不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you don't know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:33.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,没那么简单 鲍勃 我还要考虑保护孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that simple, Bob. I wanna protect the kids!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:34.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也在考虑孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:36.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,违法是会坐牢的 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From jail, Bob!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:37.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,干什么才能不违法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:39.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在明明有改变法律的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By turning down a chance to change the law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:41.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,让孩子们以后不用再隐藏能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that forces them to hide what they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:43.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们自己还不知道自己要什么 他们还只是孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They haven't decided what they are. They're still kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:46.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们是有超能力的孩子 也就是超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids with powers, which makes them Supers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:48.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管以后他们决定用不用超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whether they decide to use those powers or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:50.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样都对他们有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will benefit them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.25,0:21:52.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在最应该陪着他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a good time to be away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.05,0:21:53.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,小飞连作业都做不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash is having trouble with homework...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:55.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,小倩成天想着约会的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vi is worried about her first date{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是和那个她喜欢的男孩子 叫托尼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with that boy she likes, Tony...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:57.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后小杰又\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Jack-Jack...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.95,0:22:00.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰 小杰怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack-Jack? What's wrong with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:02.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 小杰没有任何问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, nothing's wrong with Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.22,0:22:04.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过就是普通孩子也需要很多关心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But even a normal baby needs a lot of attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:06.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我总感觉不该离开家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just not sure I can leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:08.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么不能离开家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you can leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.26,0:22:10.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定要去 只要我..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to. So that I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:12.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就可以重新正大光明的当超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can be Supers again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:14.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的孩子才能选择未来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so our kids can have that choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:16.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说你的未来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can have that choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.17,0:22:17.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,说的对 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.37,0:22:19.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,说的是我的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I can have that choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且让我上 我一定能做的非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I would do a great job!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.28,0:22:27.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管文斯顿那个倒霉数据说的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regardless of what Deavor's pie charts say or whatever...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:29.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过 他们要的是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they want you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:31.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也 一定会像我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll do a great...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:33.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}job...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.36,0:22:37.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.16,0:22:40.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,看你这样连我都跟着着难受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was excruciating to watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:42.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能对你撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't lie to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.23,0:22:45.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我被选上了很开心 更要飘飘然了 可是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice to be wanted. Flattering, you know, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:46.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想怎么选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what's the choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.77,0:22:48.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一 好好工作拿到报酬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, do this right,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.07,0:22:49.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就能搬出汽车旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get well paid, we're out of the motel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:51.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,超能力合法化对超人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and things get better for all Supers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:52.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,对孩子们也有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including our kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:54.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:57.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要在两周内找到工作 要不然我们就只能流落街头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find a job in two weeks or we're homeless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.68,0:22:59.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道这有多疯狂么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it's crazy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:01.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了家人 我得离开家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To help my family, I gotta leave it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.69,0:23:02.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,要改变法律 得先违法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To fix the law, I gotta break it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:03.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会做的很棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.89,0:23:05.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,这我也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.06,0:23:06.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,可你怎么办 还有孩子要照顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what about you? We have kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.13,0:23:07.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会看孩子 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll watch the kids, no problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.93,0:23:09.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很简单 - 很简单啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Easy. - Easy, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:11.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可真可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:12.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正如果真的有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if there is a problem,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:13.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就随时赶过来好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll drop this thing and come right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.83,0:23:15.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全没必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't need to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.07,0:23:17.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来搞定 你尽管去工作是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it, you go do this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.04,0:23:19.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,认真工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.97,0:23:22.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我做得更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do it better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:24.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是文斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deavor here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.85,0:23:26.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:27.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我同意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.78,0:23:33.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,文斯顿先生 真的谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Deavor, it's wonderful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:35.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是这也太破费了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's too generous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:36.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪里哪里 这点小事不足挂齿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nonsense! That's the least we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.46,0:23:37.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在是合作伙伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're partners now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.99,0:23:39.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么能让你们住在汽车旅馆里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't have my partners living in a motel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.96,0:23:42.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是这是谁的房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But whose house? Is it a house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我的房子 我有好几套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my house. I have several.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.23,0:23:46.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那套平时也没人住 你们尽管住就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not using that one. Stay as long as you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:48.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都不知道说什么好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.37,0:23:50.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我建议你说 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about "thanks"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:53.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是我们的新家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is our new house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.31,0:23:56.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 别太激动 是借给我们住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, easy, tiger. It's being loaned to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.81,0:23:58.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这还真舒适 豪华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is homey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,快看这地方 真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.22,0:24:02.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,文斯顿买下这里之前 别墅的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deavor bought it from an eccentric billionaire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:04.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,是一个不喜欢暴露行踪的亿万富翁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who liked to come and go without being seen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.42,0:24:07.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以房子里有好几个秘密出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so the house has multiple hidden exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.09,0:24:08.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是一个不显眼的别墅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good thing we won't stand out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.76,0:24:11.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,住在这 我们肯定不会再乱七八糟的人给盯上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't want to attract any unnecessary attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.90,0:24:13.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个院子真大啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got a big yard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.93,0:24:16.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是不是有点太夸张了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't this a bit much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.17,0:24:17.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,旁边还有森林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Near a forest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.97,0:24:19.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道你更愿意住汽车旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you rather be at the motel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:21.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有泳池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a pool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.14,0:24:24.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈的新工作到底是做什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What exactly is Mom's new job?{\r}
