Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.37,0:29:34.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的标准减法是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want us to do it this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.24,0:29:37.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不会那样做 难不成数学题还会变么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know that way! Why would they change math?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.24,0:29:39.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没事 爸爸 - 怎么做不是做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's okay, Dad. - Math is math!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.47,0:29:41.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我等妈妈回来我在做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just wait for Mom to get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.58,0:29:42.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.58,0:29:45.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这种难题我都不会做 你妈妈也做不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't understand it any better than I do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.45,0:29:47.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,外星界限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Outer Limits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.09,0:29:51.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,在远方的睡眠国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"All over Doozle-Dorf,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.49,0:29:54.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的男孩和女孩都要睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"the Fribbers of Frupp are going to sleep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.12,0:29:56.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为孩子们的哈欠连天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"'cause they just can't keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.29,0:30:00.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,在疲倦的睡眠国 大人也要睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"All over Doozle-Dorf, Doozles are dozing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.13,0:30:04.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的眼皮渐渐闭上了 头垂下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Eyelids so heavy, they're drooping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:07.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后 重点是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Closing! The point is:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.54,0:30:10.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,到了晚上每个人 每个人都躺在床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Everyone, everyone's hitting the sack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.27,0:30:13.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都睡得特别香\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Everyone's getting the sleep that they lack."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.51,0:30:16.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,市长们都喜欢吹嘘自己城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayors often brag about their cities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.71,0:30:18.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不例外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm no exception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.52,0:30:19.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,必须承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm willing to admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.78,0:30:22.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,新城是唯一一座…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that New Urbem is not the only city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.15,0:30:24.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定警察不会来找麻烦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure the police are gonna be okay with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.42,0:30:26.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,确定 你这是在帮他们的忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. You're making life easy for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.42,0:30:27.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,上次我们给警察帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They still haven't forgiven us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.83,0:30:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,到现在他们还记仇呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the last time we made life easy for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:31.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认识这边的警察局长 不会有问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the Chief of Police. There won't be a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.70,0:30:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.60,0:30:35.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是上次暗中破坏王的事 你自己去搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you alone had handled the Underminer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.23,0:30:37.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果会不一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}things would have been different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.24,0:30:38.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有别的意思哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.60,0:30:40.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且工程按照预算 提前完工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on budget and ahead of schedule...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.71,0:30:44.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎大家观摩悬浮列车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to launch our magnificent new hovertrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.34,0:30:46.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,乘坐它去往你向往的目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can get you where you need to go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.85,0:30:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且速度特别快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at ridiculous speeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.82,0:30:52.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,让列车向着美好的未来前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future is open for business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.41,0:31:13.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 车停下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. The train has stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.41,0:31:18.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,开的方向不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going the wrong direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:21.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,车走的方向不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going the wrong way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.75,0:31:22.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going after it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.62,0:31:30.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,列车的速度是160公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's really moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:32.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且还在加速 现在轨道有多长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 and climbing. How much track is built?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.86,0:31:35.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,差不多40公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 25 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:44.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道没人能让列车停下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one can shut this thing down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.91,0:31:46.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,试过了 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've tried. No-go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.28,0:31:49.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,是弹力女超人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Elastigirl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:31:58.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,能远程控制么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overrides?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.49,0:31:59.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们封锁了系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're locked out of the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:08.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 能启动保险装置吗 - 时间不够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about a fail-safe? - Not enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.84,0:32:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人打电话 我先接一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's calling! Switching over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.81,0:32:15.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂 妈妈我找不到运动鞋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mom. I can't find my high-tops{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.71,0:32:17.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸也找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Dad can't find them either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.38,0:32:19.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他不愿意打电话问你 所以只能我来问了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he won't call you and ask, so I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.58,0:32:21.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,别给你妈打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not call your mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.25,0:32:22.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,小飞 好孩子 我现在不能说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dash, honey. Can't talk right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.65,0:32:24.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,找找你床底下 还有多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look under your bed, okay. How much time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.55,0:32:26.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不到两分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Less than two minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.52,0:32:28.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一条近路 从前面的排气管传过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a shortcut. Cut through the culvert up ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.66,0:32:38.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道能不能追上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I can stay with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.43,0:34:49.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the heck was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.10,0:34:51.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家还好吗 有人受伤吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everybody all right? Is anybody injured?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.40,0:34:52.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.94,0:34:57.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看看你在搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your story better be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:03.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.52,0:35:37.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝 你怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, why are you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.75,0:35:40.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,别问了 什么也别问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.66,0:35:47.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,小倩 你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Dad. Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.03,0:35:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事 我只是现在什么话也不想说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. I don't wanna talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.23,0:35:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尼没有联系你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony didn't even call?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.90,0:35:53.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说了我现在不想说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.94,0:35:55.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 你 - 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, honey... - Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.67,0:35:59.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要是真为我好你就让我自己待会行不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want me to feel better, then leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.54,0:36:00.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.64,0:36:01.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你说 警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, there's nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.85,0:36:03.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,最讨厌的 就是那种失踪儿童案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a cop hates worse than a missing child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.18,0:36:05.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我弟弟的人儿子 今天是他一周岁生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My kid brother's son. Today is his first birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.78,0:36:07.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果要说有谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, but if anybody{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.15,0:36:09.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,能找到那个孩子 就是你了 罗曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can find that child, it's you, Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.49,0:36:12.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你是一位出色的警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're a wonderful policeman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.02,0:36:14.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来抢劫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a holdup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.83,0:36:16.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,把手举起来 转过身去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get your hands up, turn your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.93,0:36:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,把两只手举起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands behind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.20,0:36:19.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱着头 不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your heads and keep them there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.70,0:36:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.10,0:36:24.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,放下 到那边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop that. All right, now get over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.20,0:36:26.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,看紧大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.67,0:36:27.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为我们开玩笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'm kiddin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.58,0:36:32.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.08,0:36:37.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说了 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.82,0:36:40.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我搞定了 我跟你说 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it! Come on, I tell you, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.22,0:36:43.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想死么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna get killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.92,0:38:21.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.93,0:38:26.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.40,0:38:30.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.00,0:38:31.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.84,0:38:34.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.85,0:38:45.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也有 超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have powers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.29,0:38:46.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, baby,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.89,0:38:48.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你身上一点伤都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there's not a scratch on you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.96,0:38:50.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是不是直接穿过了门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you go through the locked door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.69,0:38:52.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,拥有穿墙的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are those your powers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.96,0:38:55.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁这么厉害能变出好多分身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who can multiply like rabbits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.06,0:38:58.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,还能任意穿过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and go right through any solid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.00,0:39:04.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.81,0:39:11.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 嗨亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello? - Hey, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.25,0:39:13.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没给我打电话 - 哦 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You weren't gonna call me? - Oh, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:15.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,没打 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I mean, yes, yeah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.25,0:39:17.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想打来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just didn't wanna wake you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.69,0:39:20.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才在院子里发生了很奇特的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The strangest thing just happened out in the yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.76,0:39:21.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是不是把你吵醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like I just woke you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.89,0:39:23.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.39,0:39:25.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只是 小杰他 - 他出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's just, Jack-Jack... - He had an accident!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.09,0:39:26.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.16,0:39:28.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在就回家 我就不该…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming home right now! I never should have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.10,0:39:30.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰没出事 你就安心工作 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No accident. Stay there and finish your mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.43,0:39:31.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never should...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.97,0:39:34.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么 你觉得我搞不定家务事么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You don't think I can do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.04,0:39:36.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不 对不起 我说错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Sorry. I misspoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.74,0:39:38.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要我回家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you need me to come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.14,0:39:41.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不不 不用 我能搞定 我这很顺利 一切都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. No, I've got this. Everything's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.01,0:39:42.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚才说小杰怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened with Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.91,0:39:46.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么 他非常非常健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing. He's in excellent health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.15,0:39:48.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.25,0:39:50.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小倩的约会怎么样 - 呃...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How was Violet's date? - Uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:52.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,约会是在今天晚上 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was tonight, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.72,0:39:55.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.29,0:39:57.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有问题 我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All fine and good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.30,0:39:59.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰有没有闹 乖乖睡着了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Jack-Jack went down with no trouble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:01.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 没错 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, yes, no trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.03,0:40:02.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,小飞的作业 写完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Dash got his homework done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.90,0:40:04.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,都写完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.17,0:40:05.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以 不是我刚一离开家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, things haven't spiraled out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.44,0:40:06.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,就乱成一锅粥了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of control the moment I left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.44,0:40:08.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然听起来很不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amazing as it may seem,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.31,0:40:10.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我和孩子们并没有出任何问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it has been quite uneventful in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.98,0:40:12.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:15.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我救了一辆列车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved a runaway train!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.88,0:40:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是太刺激了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was so great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.42,0:40:21.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,市长也在场 参加新列车的剪彩仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mayor was there to cut the ribbon on this new train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.19,0:40:22.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人紧随身后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elastigirl pursued the train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.99,0:40:25.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,追上列车 并成功救下了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was able to successfully activate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.16,0:40:27.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,市长说了几句话 剪了彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blah, blah, blah. He says a few words, cuts the ribbon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.46,0:40:28.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果列车一出站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the train starts pulling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.79,0:40:30.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,就朝着反方向冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of the station backwards...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.33,0:40:32.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,全新的气垫列车轨道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...track of its brand new hovertrain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.03,0:40:33.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,出现故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...malfunctioned...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.80,0:40:35.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,多亏了弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...thanking Elastigirl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.20,0:40:37.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superhero Elastigirl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.47,0:40:38.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elastigirl...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.81,0:40:42.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后 没人受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boom! No casualties!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.08,0:40:43.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,驾驶特制的摩托车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...specialized motorbike,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,拯救了所有乘客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saving all of the passengers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.95,0:40:46.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,一件接着一件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing leads to another{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.05,0:40:47.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后 我追了上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and suddenly, I go after it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.22,0:40:49.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你说 真是太险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, honey, it was a saga!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.52,0:40:51.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,这真是太棒了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fantastic, honey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.49,0:40:53.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你出任务的第一天晚上就这么成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on your first night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.89,0:40:56.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我为你感到骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so proud of you, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.93,0:40:58.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我为你也感到骄傲 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm proud of you, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.46,0:41:01.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你也想出来工作 很快就可以了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you want to get out there and you will soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.13,0:41:03.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定会非常出色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you'll be amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.10,0:41:04.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能做到这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't have done this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.33,0:41:05.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是因为你把家事都安排好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you hadn't taken over so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.97,0:41:07.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你为我做了这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for handling everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.80,0:41:09.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这都没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.20,0:41:12.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你 亲爱的 我很快就回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, honey. I'll be back soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.31,0:41:15.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 做个好梦 - 你也是 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sweet dreams. - Sweet dreams, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.43,0:41:34.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Hey, Dad, it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.33,0:41:37.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是等妈妈回来好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'll just wait for Mom to get home."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.13,0:41:40.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,说的就像她能…我知道怎么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if she could... I know how to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.87,0:41:42.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能搞定数学题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can do math.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.12,0:41:54.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, brother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.12,0:41:59.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,等妈妈回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.23,0:42:02.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这算什么 临时父母么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I, a substitute parent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.26,0:42:07.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们改了解法又不是我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not my fault they changed math.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.94,0:42:18.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,醒醒 小飞 醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, buddy. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.28,0:42:21.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好像琢磨出来你的数学作业怎么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I understand your math assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:24.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,考试之前还有点时间 我们还来得及复习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still have some time to finish it before your test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.92,0:42:26.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,接着做 把所有的数字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So first, you wanna put all the numbers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.89,0:42:28.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,都放到等号后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by themselves on one side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.66,0:42:30.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,就要改变正负号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you change the sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.49,0:42:33.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,也就是说正变成负 负变成正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means a plus becomes a minus and a minus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.53,0:42:35.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你懂了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:36.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,耶 你真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.45,0:42:53.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Uh, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.01,0:42:54.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们搬新家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in a new house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.35,0:42:57.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我特意在你的柜子门上写了新地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did write my address on your locker...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.62,0:42:59.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,用的还是不褪色的墨水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in permanent ink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.66,0:43:01.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来这个是你写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, is that what that is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.96,0:43:03.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是忘了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you forget?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.46,0:43:05.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,忘了 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.26,0:43:08.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真逗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.53,0:43:13.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,给你加一分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Points for funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.24,0:43:16.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,是因为那个奇怪装束的事么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, was it the weird outfit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.37,0:43:18.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可是有原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there's a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.97,0:43:21.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们学校有戏曲表演课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in a drama class...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.11,0:43:23.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后 作业是要演莎士比亚的剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they just wanna do Shakespeare...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.31,0:43:25.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后就是这种东西让小孩们喜欢看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they're like, "Try to make it relevant for the kids."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.28,0:43:27.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就说演超人 小孩最喜欢超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, like, "Oh, superheroes! Kids love superheroes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.99,0:43:29.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来想穿另外一种紧身服的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna wear one kind of tights...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.95,0:43:31.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then they're like,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.22,0:43:32.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 你得穿别种的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"No, wear these other kind of tights."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.52,0:43:33.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认识你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.40,0:43:44.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,很多人对于今天的演讲非常关注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many say your speech today is critical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.57,0:43:47.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,两派人都是为人民福祉而努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both sides just want the best for their people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.34,0:43:51.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们马上就能让这地区迎来和平了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are so close to finally getting peace in the region.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.21,0:43:53.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都好久没上过电视了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't done this in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.11,0:43:55.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系 救列车就是个好开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is good. The train gives us momentum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.41,0:43:57.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就放心去 展现你平时的魅力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go out there and be your charming self...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.65,0:43:59.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,使其充分发挥作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and capitalize on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人 那边已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms. Elastigirl, they're ready for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.59,0:44:03.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,上台前 伸伸腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, stretch a leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.29,0:44:07.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 查德 聊得很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Chad. It was fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.03,0:44:09.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,大使女士 这是你的文件 我们去屋顶乘坐直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ambassador, your documents. We're moving to the rooftop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.30,0:44:12.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,大使女士 你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Madame Ambassador, hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.30,0:44:13.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you are Elastigirl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.67,0:44:16.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定得跟你握握手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why now I'm shaking your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.17,0:44:18.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,之前你被迫隐姓埋名 我很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was so sad when you went underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.30,0:44:22.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到你现在身着华丽的超能装 重现于世 我真高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am glad to see you back in your shiny outfit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.31,0:44:23.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,您跟我说这些我深受鼓舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means so much coming from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.71,0:44:25.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝您演讲顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck with your speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.04,0:44:26.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,走这边 大使女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Ambassador.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.41,0:44:27.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,要让和平永存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring lasting peace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.75,0:44:29.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会的 你也要继续打击犯罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will, when you defeat evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.65,0:44:31.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.75,0:44:33.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,三…二…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.29,0:44:35.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,过去十五年里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For over 15 years,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.59,0:44:37.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,超人们一直隐姓埋名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}superheroes have been in hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.19,0:44:39.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,生活在一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forced into it by a society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.19,0:44:40.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不愿意帮助 支持他们的社会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no longer willing to support them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.73,0:44:42.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That may soon be changing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.36,0:44:44.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为社会上出现了支持超人回归的运动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}due to a growing movement to bring the Supers back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.80,0:44:46.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我们请来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, fresh on the heels of her own{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.63,0:44:48.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,列车失控事件中力挽狂澜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heroic save of a runaway train...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.57,0:44:52.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,以闪亮形象出现在世人面前的 弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sporting a new look, is the superhero, Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.11,0:44:53.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎你 - 你好 查德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Welcome! - Hello, Chad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.44,0:44:55.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在看来你的支持率很高啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the polls are going in your direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.61,0:44:57.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,的确是 这是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true. Things are good...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.35,0:44:58.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.75,0:45:00.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.45,0:45:02.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你注意到我了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I have your attention?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.65,0:45:04.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 查德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Chad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.09,0:45:05.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然你注意到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.35,0:45:07.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我出现在你的屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm appearing on your screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.22,0:45:10.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,读着另一个屏幕上别人让我说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reading the words I'm saying off of another screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.29,0:45:12.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,屏幕无处不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screens are everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.19,0:45:13.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,屏幕能控制我们的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are controlled by screens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.13,0:45:20.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,而掌控者 就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And screens are controlled by me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.10,0:45:21.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,屏霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screenslaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.11,0:45:25.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我控制者这次采访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I control this broadcast...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.24,0:45:27.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,也控制着坐在你面前的这个愚蠢的主持人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this idiotic anchorman you see before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.65,0:45:29.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.38,0:45:30.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,信号遭到劫持 我去检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The signal's been hijacked. I'll check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.38,0:45:32.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,记住 千万不要看屏幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at any monitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.15,0:45:34.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以在空中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could hijack the ambassador's aerocade...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.42,0:45:36.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,直接劫持大使乘坐的直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while it's still airborne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.72,0:45:38.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,对吧 弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, Elastigirl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.63,0:45:43.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近的窗户 最近的窗户在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nearest window! Where's the nearest window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.54,0:45:57.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 弹力女超人去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, what's going on? - Where's Elastigirl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.41,0:45:59.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,是哪个呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.65,0:46:09.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人 你在这干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elastigirl! What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.56,0:46:11.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,大使现在有危险了 她乘坐的是哪架直升机…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ambassador is in danger. Which chopper is she...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.89,0:46:13.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.90,0:46:17.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟上去 尽量接近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow them and get me close!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.77,0:46:22.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,赶紧找个地方安全降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the sky, and touch down safely!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.51,0:46:35.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,退后 弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down! It's Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.15,0:46:36.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,回到座位上 大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay in your seat, ma'am!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.43,0:46:45.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们遭到了袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're under attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.56,0:46:48.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点去 快去保护大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick, go! Protect the ambassador!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.90,0:46:53.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,把舱门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.20,0:46:54.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,快照她说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do as she says!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.44,0:46:57.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们都会游泳吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you all swim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.54,0:46:59.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 会的 - 不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.53,0:47:23.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们马上就要弹射了 都别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have to slingshot! Hang on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.51,0:47:32.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.84,0:47:34.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm perfectly fine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.46,0:47:47.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,男生们都是混蛋 超能力最没用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys are jerks and superheroes suck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.26,0:47:48.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.56,0:47:50.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,他就看了一眼我穿超能装的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He takes one look at me in that suit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.46,0:47:54.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二天见到我的时候他就假装不认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and decides to pretend he doesn't even know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.37,0:47:56.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,他也是在保护自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's protecting himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.47,0:47:59.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是他真的看到了你 还是忘掉比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he really did see you, it's best that he forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.34,0:48:01.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,对你也有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's better for you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.27,0:48:03.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都记不清这些年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you how many memories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.38,0:48:05.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,迪瑞克消除了多少记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dicker's had to erase over the years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.68,0:48:07.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是有人发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when someone figured out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.48,0:48:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我和你妈妈超人身份的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your mother's or my identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.28,0:48:11.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,是迪瑞克搞的鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Dicker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.62,0:48:13.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你和他说了托尼的事 - 小倩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You told him about Tony! - Honey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.85,0:48:16.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是因为叫迪瑞克抹除了托尼的记忆 所以他才会忘了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had me erased from Tony's mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.30,0:48:32.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我恨死超能力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate superheroes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.01,0:48:34.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我再也不要做超人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I renounce them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.35,0:48:42.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要做超人啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I renounce them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.93,0:48:52.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,姐这是青春期叛逆吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she having adolescence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.00,0:48:55.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,最新的报告表明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new report out today shows that,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:57.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于决策问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it comes to decision-making...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.50,0:48:59.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们觉得 通过让猴子扔飞镖的方式做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people have more trust in a monkey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.34,0:49:00.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,比让国会议员们决定更靠谱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throwing darts than Congress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.70,0:49:02.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了托尼 有抗议吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on, Tommy? A protest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.87,0:49:04.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些人是来声援的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here in support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.98,0:49:07.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,声援？ 声援什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Support? Support of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.31,0:49:09.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们是来声援你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, in support of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.99,0:49:17.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for coming out. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.62,0:49:20.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 哦天呢 真是太谢谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my goodness. Thanks so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.39,0:49:21.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.53,0:49:22.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你拿的什么牌子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does your sign say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.93,0:49:31.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,超人应该合法化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supers should be legal now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.54,0:49:33.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你说 你才知道啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk to ya. Oh, what do ya know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.84,0:49:34.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾伦伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellenwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.94,0:49:36.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在想起回我电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, now you wanna return my calls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.98,0:49:38.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,聊超人的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about superheroes, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.34,0:49:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,过会我再联系你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. I'll have to call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.04,0:49:41.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that felt good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.45,0:49:42.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,菲利西亚 让那边别挂电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felicia, hold my calls, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.65,0:49:44.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,起作用啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! It's working!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.45,0:49:46.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,大使今天刚刚发表了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, the ambassador made a big speech{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.59,0:49:47.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于超能力的重要演讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about superheroes today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.79,0:49:49.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来救人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns out saving someone's life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.52,0:49:50.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是能给他们留下好印象的 想不到吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes a good impression on them. Who knew, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.92,0:49:53.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我接到了来自世界各地的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting calls from all over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.43,0:49:55.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,媒体曝光率提高了72%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Media awareness is up 72%.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.83,0:49:57.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,超能力合法化已经成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The push for superhero legalization{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.93,0:49:59.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界名列前茅的潮流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is becoming a worldwide movement!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.93,0:50:01.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,下一阶段我还有个大计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have big plans for our next move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.83,0:50:03.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要在还是举办一次海上峰会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have a summit at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.67,0:50:04.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,就用我们的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll use our ship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.77,0:50:07.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,把世界各地的超人和领导人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll gather leaders and Supers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.01,0:50:09.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 都请到船上去 - 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- from all over the world. - That's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.74,0:50:10.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.88,0:50:12.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴支持率上升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm happy the numbers are up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.55,0:50:15.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴大使也支持合法化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm happy the ambassador is pro-superhero...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.65,0:50:17.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,看到你高兴 我也很欣喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm happy you're happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.42,0:50:20.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你嘴上出很高兴 可是 我怎么感觉不到呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hearing that you're happy, but why am I not feeling it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.69,0:50:22.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我还没有抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I didn't get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.42,0:50:23.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,屏霸还在外面害人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screenslaver is still out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.83,0:50:26.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我按照他的游戏规则走 赢了这一轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I did was play his game and win this round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.66,0:50:27.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一定不会善罢甘休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna want more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.83,0:50:29.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,等他出手的时候 我们肯定输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and as long as he gets to play, he wins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.96,0:50:32.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我做生意其中一条心得就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing I've learned in business?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.03,0:50:33.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好的享受当下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smell the flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.97,0:50:35.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,鲜花难得开一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't bloom that often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.50,0:50:36.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,不然将来你的墓碑上会写着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want on your tombstone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.97,0:50:38.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,她操心到老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"She worried a lot"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.11,0:50:40.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, stop talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.11,0:50:41.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,带她去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.58,0:50:49.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这真是太令人兴奋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just so exciting, isn't it? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.59,0:50:53.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wow. Uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.52,0:50:56.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人 你来啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! Elastigirl, there you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.73,0:50:58.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - I didn't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.63,0:51:01.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,凯伦 你快振作一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get yourself together, Karen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.97,0:51:05.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 我是穿越侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, my superhero name is Voyd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.07,0:51:09.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是 很想感激你 那个 敢于站出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna thank you, for, like, for being you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.01,0:51:14.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 让我来展示一下我的超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what I can do, um, is this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.72,0:51:21.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.79,0:51:25.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常精彩 有多维度的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is impressive. Very interdimensional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.56,0:51:27.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我之前觉得自己被社会摈弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt like an outcast before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.76,0:51:32.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在 自从你勇敢现身之后我就觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now, with you being you, I feel like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.90,0:51:34.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 做回自己了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yay, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.97,0:51:37.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我用飞机把他们从世界各地接过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I flew them in from all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.94,0:51:39.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,之前他们都不现身的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've all been in hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.80,0:51:42.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们有各种各样的超能力 身份长期保密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have powers, secret identities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.01,0:51:44.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,还给自己起了名号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and names they've given themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.88,0:51:47.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是人鹰侠 很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Screech. It's a pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.18,0:51:48.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直认为超人最好的榜样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always considered you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.58,0:51:50.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,就应该是你这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the gold standard for superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.65,0:51:52.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢您 您太客气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thanks. You're too nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.79,0:51:54.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的名字叫 飞砖侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am called Brick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.69,0:51:58.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 你从哪里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you, Brick. Uh, where are you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.06,0:51:59.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,威斯康辛州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wisconsin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.63,0:52:02.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 弹力女超人 他想你的能力是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Elastigirl. I assume your powers are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.76,0:52:05.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,用电流进行打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, zapping things electrically...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.03,0:52:07.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,充电啊 发出闪电啊之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}charging things, bolts of lightning, that kind of stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.57,0:52:09.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫反胃侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name's Reflux.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.04,0:52:12.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可能觉得这其实是胃病 或是超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medical condition or superpower, you decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.01,0:52:13.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是讲个笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a little line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.64,0:52:15.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,让大家轻松一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say just to put people at ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.08,0:52:16.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不介意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope I don't offend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.21,0:52:18.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不不 你说的很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no, no. Reflux. Love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.68,0:52:22.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很期待能跟你共事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I do look forward to working with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.58,0:52:25.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,这能力太棒了 保持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that is impressive. Keep practicing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.59,0:52:34.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴 今天很成功 祝贺你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm beat. Congratulations. Big day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.96,0:52:37.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安 女士们 我们明天早上再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, ladies. I will see you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.53,0:52:38.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.83,0:52:40.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,感觉不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be nice for you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.54,0:52:42.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,隔了这么久再一次成为焦点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being out front after all this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.10,0:52:43.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,成为焦点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out front?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.67,0:52:46.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 毕竟上次当超人已经是很久之前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's been a while since your superhero days...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.24,0:52:48.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,那时候 感觉你只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and even then, you were kind of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.08,0:52:49.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,活在超能先生的阴影里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Mr. Incredible's shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.68,0:52:51.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,对此我可不敢苟同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, I beg to differ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.11,0:52:53.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可没说你不够耀眼 你很耀眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not... I'm not saying you weren't big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.12,0:52:55.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天你可算的上是超级巨星了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you were, and are, a superstar...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.12,0:52:58.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是 现在的舞台是完全属于你一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you have the stage to yourself now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.05,0:53:00.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们的注意力想不集中在你身上都难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And people have to pay attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.09,0:53:01.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你准备扯"这是个男人的世界"这套说辞咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you mean, "It's a man's world" and all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.89,0:53:03.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你觉得现在的世界是怎么样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what world do you live in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:05.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你哥哥是公司的总裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother runs DEVTECH.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.10,0:53:09.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才不想做他的工作 我搞发明 他负责推销\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want his job. I invent, he sells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.23,0:53:12.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在问你 我们两个谁的影响力更大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ask you, which of us has the greater influence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.80,0:53:14.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这人有两面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which side of me are you asking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.27,0:53:15.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,理想家 还是批评家 你想问哪一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The believer or the cynic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.74,0:53:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,批评家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cynic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.01,0:53:18.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我觉得 推销的工作更重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would say selling is more important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.74,0:53:20.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为推销员越厉害 吸引的顾客越多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because the best sellers have the most buyers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.78,0:53:22.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至卖什么都不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter what you're selling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.58,0:53:24.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,最重要的是如何吸引人们来买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It only matters what people buy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.32,0:53:26.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的很对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.02,0:53:27.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果有一天我能揭示宇宙起源的真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I discovered the origin of the universe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.99,0:53:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我哥哥也能想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my brother would find a way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.62,0:53:32.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,把它包装成一种 足部按摩疗法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to market it as a, uh, foot massager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.93,0:53:36.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么 理想家会如何看待这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what would the believer say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.83,0:53:39.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,理想家认为 你要活出自己的风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The believer would tell you to make your mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.16,0:53:41.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用看别人的眼色表达自己 坚持自己的主张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't wait for permission, assert yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.63,0:53:43.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,用自己的意志改变现状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and impose your will on the status quo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.14,0:53:45.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说话很像我哥哥 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sounds like my brother. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.00,0:53:46.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说话很像我哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound like my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.31,0:53:47.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,那他做的没错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's not wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.71,0:53:49.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,要想得到他人的回应 这可算得上一门技术活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is an art to getting a reaction...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.04,0:53:50.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么抓到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! I know how to get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.78,0:53:53.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抓我哥哥么 - 不 我是说屏霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My brother? - No. Screenslaver!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.81,0:53:56.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可是技术专家 我需要锁定某个信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're tech-savvy. I need to lock onto a signal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.62,0:53:57.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,追踪它的来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and trace its origin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.78,0:53:58.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最快要花多久能把所需的设备弄好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How fast can you slap something together{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.92,0:54:00.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后跟我在机场会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and meet me at the airport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.12,0:54:01.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,去机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Airport?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.12,0:54:02.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要立马出城一趟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need to go out of town, pronto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.89,0:54:04.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我明早五点就能准备好设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can get your contraption together by 5:00 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.06,0:54:06.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得上电视 联系查德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get on TV. Chad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.16,0:54:07.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚就让我哥哥安排查德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get my brother to set up an exclusive with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.93,0:54:09.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,在新闻节目里对你进行专访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tonight on the newscast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.10,0:54:10.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,直接用电话连线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish our interview by phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.30,0:54:11.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,提高知名度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promote the hell out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.67,0:54:13.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,脱离屏霸的控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Independence from Screenslavery!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.07,0:54:15.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 查德新闻频道 - 一举成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chad tonight. - Boom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.07,0:54:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是迪瑞克 - 嘿 迪瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dicker. - Yeah, hey, Rick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.74,0:54:22.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还记得我跟你提过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember that kid I mentioned to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.34,0:54:23.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个叫托尼·莱丁格的孩子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony Rydinger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.64,0:54:25.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个消除记忆的小男孩吧 记得那孩子看起来不错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind wipe? Yeah, nice kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.35,0:54:27.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还消除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you also wiped out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.05,0:54:29.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,他周五晚上要和我女儿巴小倩约会的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Friday night date my daughter had with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.05,0:54:31.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,严格说来他把小倩彻底忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, you wiped out my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.69,0:54:33.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 这项技术还不成熟 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops. Not an exact science, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.96,0:54:35.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,瑞克 你一定得帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick, you gotta help me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.83,0:54:38.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,小倩快恨死我了 还有你 恨超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Violet hates me, and you, and superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.86,0:54:41.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得想办法补救一下 托尼的资料你手上有多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta fix this. What do you know about Tony?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.77,0:54:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.23,0:54:45.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来是个挺守规矩的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems like a good kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.84,0:54:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,受欢迎 喜欢运动 音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Popular, plays sports, music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.00,0:54:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,父母开了家餐馆 叫"快乐拼盘" 他有时候也会在餐馆帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parents own The Happy Platter, kid works there part time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.84,0:54:54.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,"快乐拼盘"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy Platter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.71,0:54:59.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们干嘛要开车跑这么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did we drive all the way across town{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.25,0:55:01.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,来这个"快乐拼盘"餐馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for The Happy Platter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.05,0:55:04.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要那边的四人座 靠着树林的那个桌子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd like a booth over there, near the philodendron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.69,0:55:06.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,是不是很不错 坐在树林附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, right? Near the philodendron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.09,0:55:12.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个快乐餐馆 我看一点都不快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This platter doesn't look all that happy to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.26,0:55:14.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来挺无聊的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks bored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.23,0:55:16.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就成了无聊大拼盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha-ha! The Bored Platter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.13,0:55:18.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得小倩肯定吃腻了路边的快餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought Vi would want a change of pace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.70,0:55:19.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,要换换口味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from drive-in food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.87,0:55:21.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢吃路边的快餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like drive-in food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.77,0:55:23.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,换换口味该不是只吃蔬菜吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this mean vegetables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.74,0:55:25.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,营养要平衡就得吃蔬菜 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A balanced diet means vegetables, kiddo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.74,0:55:27.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,要习惯多吃蔬菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.85,0:55:29.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.88,0:55:31.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.48,0:55:33.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她没事吧 - 小倩 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is she all right? - Violet, are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.09,0:55:34.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么好看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing to see here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.29,0:55:36.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能你需要更多餐巾纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, more napkins would be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.05,0:55:37.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 我没事 - 这种情况总是会出现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm fine, I'm fine. - It happens all the time here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.19,0:55:38.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就擦干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mops it right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.09,0:55:40.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,她平时喝东西的时候 可没有这么激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Normally, she doesn't ever drip like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.99,0:55:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们还要水吗 先生 - 要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you like water, sir? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.16,0:55:46.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,来些水吧 这是我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I would. This is my daughter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.13,0:55:47.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你一定认识的 对吧 - 我的天 别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- who you must know, right? - God. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.83,0:55:49.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 她叫小倩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - Violet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.17,0:55:50.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 小倩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Violet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.47,0:55:52.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 小倩 打个招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Vi, say hi to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.94,0:55:54.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,别逼我 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't push it, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.31,0:55:56.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫巴小飞 是她弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Dash, her little brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.31,0:55:57.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.48,0:55:59.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这水的味道真是不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm. This is really good water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.95,0:56:01.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,很是清新\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very refreshing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.25,0:56:02.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,山泉水 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spring water, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.12,0:56:05.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 先生 应该就是自来水吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, sir. I think it's tap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.02,0:56:06.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it is very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.79,0:56:08.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常棒的自来水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent tap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.19,0:56:10.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.33,0:56:12.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.16,0:56:13.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她干嘛去了 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd she go? - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.89,0:56:17.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,找地方发火去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To find a good place to be angry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.00,0:56:19.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚我们要连线采访一位特别嘉宾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, we go now to a special remote interview...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.90,0:56:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.10,0:56:22.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么样 查德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you feeling, Chad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.14,0:56:23.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You doing all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.41,0:56:25.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很好 医生给我做了检查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. The doctors checked me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.91,0:56:27.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我根本不记得当时的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no memory of the event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.91,0:56:29.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,实话跟你说 看到录像里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta tell you, it's pretty strange{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.81,0:56:31.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,前几天的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see a recording...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.18,0:56:33.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,自己却一点印象都没有 感觉真的很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of yourself the night before and have no recollection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.85,0:56:35.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家不用担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think anyone needs to worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.42,0:56:37.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天晚上我们的安全措施非常的严密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've taken many precautions tonight though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.89,0:56:39.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.22,0:56:42.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在调查一个案子 在一个视野开阔 安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On a case, in a secure undisclosed location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.26,0:56:43.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想先聊聊你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna talk about you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.96,0:56:46.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,先从最近救下失控列车的事迹开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}starting with your save of a runaway train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.36,0:56:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有一段独家的未经过编辑的录像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's an exclusive unedited clip{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.93,0:56:50.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,是装在你身上的摄像头记录下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from your own suit cam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.37,0:56:51.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,请播放录像吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roll the clip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.47,0:56:54.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,列车动起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's really moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.24,0:56:56.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,列车的速度是160公里每小时 而且还在加速 已经建好的轨道有多长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 and climbing. How much track is built?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.97,0:56:59.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,差不多四十公里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 25 miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.91,0:57:03.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,屏霸中止了这个节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Screenslaver interrupts this program...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.11,0:57:04.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,有重要的事情要宣布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for an important announcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.55,0:57:06.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,丫的 她猜中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be damned. She knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.45,0:57:08.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,接下来就看你的设备管不管用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if your gadget works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.22,0:57:10.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,剩下的录像就不用看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother watching the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.49,0:57:11.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.99,0:57:14.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人无法拯救城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elastigirl doesn't save the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.23,0:57:17.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是推迟了自己失败之日的到来而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She only postpones her defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.10,0:57:19.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,可她至少还在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And while she postpones her defeat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.30,0:57:22.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你们只会吃着薯片 看着她解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you eat chips and watch her confront problems...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.97,0:57:25.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些你们自己懒得解决的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you are too lazy to deal with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.24,0:57:28.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,超人们满足了你们愚蠢的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superheroes are part of your brainless desire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.14,0:57:31.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,用虚拟代替真实生活的愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to replace true experience with simulation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.38,0:57:34.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不会说话 只会看脱口秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't talk, you watch talk shows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.88,0:57:38.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,天天就看那些有奖竞赛节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't play games, you watch game shows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.45,0:57:41.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,旅行 恋爱 冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel, relationships, risk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.52,0:57:44.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的这些有意义的人生经历\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every meaningful experience must be packaged...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.46,0:57:48.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,都包装在电视节目里 供你们远远的观赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and delivered to you to watch at a distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.03,0:57:50.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你们就能一直躲在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that you can remain ever sheltered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.50,0:57:52.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,被动接受这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever passive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.20,0:57:54.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,变成了贪婪的消费者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever ravenous consumers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.60,0:57:57.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,一直躺在沙发上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who can't bring themselves to rise from their couches...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.61,0:58:02.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不努力 这都不是真正的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}break a sweat and participate in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.04,0:58:04.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们想受到超人们的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want superheroes to protect you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.61,0:58:08.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你们也因为有人保护你们 变得越发软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make yourselves ever more powerless in the process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.92,0:58:12.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们自认为 会有人照顾你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you tell yourselves you're being looked after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.45,0:58:14.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,会有人给你们开创美好未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That your interests are being served.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.59,0:58:17.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,会有人维护你们的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your rights are being upheld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.46,0:58:20.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,长此以往 现有的体制一面榨干你们的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that the system can keep stealing from you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.60,0:58:23.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,另一面还对你们报以微笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}smiling at you all the while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.47,0:58:27.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀 叫你们的超人走狗们来阻止我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, send your Supers to stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.17,0:58:29.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们就吃着零食 看看电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab your snacks, watch your screens,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.50,0:58:31.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and see what happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.61,0:58:34.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们已不再是局面的掌控者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are no longer in control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.64,0:58:36.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.79,1:00:19.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到了什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.24,1:01:11.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.78,1:01:45.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.28,1:01:48.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还问什么情况 你把那些证据都给毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened is you destroyed my evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.35,1:01:50.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事 我犯什么法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? What did I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.12,1:01:51.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you guys do to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.59,1:01:55.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,厉害啊 你个小混混 还怪体制不行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, punk. Blame the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.36,1:01:57.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的追踪器太好用了 伊芙琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your tracker worked like a charm, Evelyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.26,1:01:58.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是个天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.53,1:01:59.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, shucks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.43,1:02:02.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是你这个天才背后的天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just the genius behind the genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.23,1:02:04.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.60,1:02:08.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们今天又开始学分数 小数和 百分数了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're doing fractions and denismals and percentages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.60,1:02:09.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我题目做不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't get 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.67,1:02:10.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.81,1:02:12.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,上次不是学会了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't we get all caught up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.27,1:02:13.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 我上次是学会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we were caught up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.71,1:02:17.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在学的是分数 百分数和小"书"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now we're doing fractions and percentages and demicels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.18,1:02:18.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,小数不是小"书"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decimals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.55,1:02:19.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于超能跑车的最新情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the addition of the Incredibile,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.85,1:02:21.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,它之前的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the super car...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.25,1:02:23.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,是那位著名的超人 超能先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once driven by superhero, Mr. Incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.62,1:02:26.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意 只有等你富可敌国的时候才买得起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the kind of thing you buy when you have everything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.59,1:02:28.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说车子已经修不好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said it was beyond repair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.93,1:02:30.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看 车的状态非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it was in perfect condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.46,1:02:32.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你原来的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to drive that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.26,1:02:33.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们还说车子彻底毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said it was destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.76,1:02:35.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,之前人们以为这辆车已经被毁或者不翼而飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long thought lost or destroyed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.63,1:02:37.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这辆车还是出现在私人拍卖会上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the famous car turned up at private auction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.80,1:02:39.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说 车已经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said it was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.30,1:02:41.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.21,1:02:51.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这愚蠢的瀑布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid water feature!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.68,1:02:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这辆车装有一些非常棒的配件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This car is just loaded with amazing gadgets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.45,1:02:55.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,愿意介绍一下么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Care to demonstrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.62,1:02:57.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也希望介绍给大家 但我们现在还没搞清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd love to, but we haven't figured out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.79,1:02:59.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,如何启动这些装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how to make them work yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.29,1:03:04.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇 是你在操控么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! It works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.90,1:03:09.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干什么 小飞 这可不是你的玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? This is not a toy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.37,1:03:10.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你启动了火箭炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a rocket launcher!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.64,1:03:12.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,太棒了 按哪个键能发射火箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweet! Which one launches the rocket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.64,1:03:14.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,这又不是你的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! This is not your car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.37,1:03:15.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,那也不是你的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your car, either!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.71,1:03:17.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,是我的车 这是超能跑车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is so! It's the Incredibile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.51,1:03:19.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那车怎么在那个人手上 - 车不应该在他手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why's that guy have it? - He shouldn't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.54,1:03:21.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,发射火箭 火箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch the rockets! Launch the rockets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.31,1:03:22.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,火箭 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launch the rockets!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.78,1:03:24.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不会乱发射火箭的 - 我要炸炸炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm not launching anything! - I wanna blow it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.32,1:03:25.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为我会让那个有钱的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think I want an angry rich guy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.39,1:03:26.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,来找我麻烦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming after me right now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.89,1:03:28.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我都尽量不去 - 我都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- when I'm trying not to... - I'm not sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.62,1:03:29.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这里是什么情况 马克 - 让你妈妈为我们分心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- what's happened here, Mark. - Distract your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.69,1:03:31.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里的人们都散开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But everyone here has scattered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.39,1:03:33.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们应该马上撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm afraid I'll need to move at any minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.29,1:03:35.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的车在这有钱人手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rich guy got my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.70,1:03:40.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,老爸 你不去把跑车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're not gonna steal your car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.47,1:03:41.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,从那个有钱人那里偷回来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back from the rich guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.58,1:03:52.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the heck is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.38,1:03:58.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰居然有超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack-Jack has powers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.42,1:03:59.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,对呀 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.55,1:04:00.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你早就知道了 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You knew about this? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.99,1:04:02.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么你不告诉我们 - 我说不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why didn't you tell us? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.82,1:04:05.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可是你的孩子 我们有权知道这些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're your kids. We need to know these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.36,1:04:06.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 告诉妈妈了吗 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you tell Mom? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.66,1:04:08.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么不说 - 你妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? - Your mother is not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.56,1:04:10.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你肯定是不想让我们不知道吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd want us to tell you, wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.30,1:04:11.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么不告诉妈妈 - 因为我不想让她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why would you not tell Mom? - Because I didn't wanna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.63,1:04:12.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.84,1:04:14.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别这样 爸爸 - 我现在还不是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, man. - Because it's not the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.04,1:04:15.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能这样 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.30,1:04:16.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样真不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So uncool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.41,1:04:18.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我还没想好怎么说 行了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm formulating, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.54,1:04:21.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也刚知道这个事 我需要消化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taking in information, I'm processing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:23.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要学做数学题 还要补救男朋友的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing the math, I'm fixing the boyfriend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.51,1:04:24.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要哄好小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and keeping the baby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.75,1:04:25.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,免得他变成喷火的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from turning into a flaming monster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.98,1:04:27.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要怎么同时做好这么多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.38,1:04:30.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是在努力适应环境 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By rolling with the punches, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.55,1:04:33.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能胡乱做一通就完事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I eat thunder and crap lightning, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.29,1:04:34.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我是著名的超能先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm Mr. Incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.86,1:04:38.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是能力不足先生 也不是一般般先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Mr. So-So or Mr. Mediocre-Guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.40,1:04:40.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是超能先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Incredible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.60,1:04:44.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该找鲁修斯叔叔帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should call Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.84,1:04:46.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 我自己能处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.50,1:04:48.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会去求…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way I'm gonna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.92,1:04:59.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.49,1:05:02.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去给鲁修斯叔叔打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm calling Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.89,1:05:08.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看挺正常的 是什么时候开始的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks normal to me. When did this start happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.63,1:05:10.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,从何莉开始工作的时候开始的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since Helen got the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.66,1:05:12.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那她应该知道这事吧 - 你开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I assume she knows? - Are you kidding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.60,1:05:13.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定不能跟她说这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell her about this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.90,1:05:15.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,她可在外面忙那些超人的工作呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not while she's doing hero work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.43,1:05:16.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.74,1:05:18.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们 加把劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.10,1:05:19.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么能光让男人们做拯救世界的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave the saving the world to the men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.64,1:05:21.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得这样不行 - 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think so. - Mama!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.01,1:05:22.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定要成功的照顾好孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to succeed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:24.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样的话 她在外面才能成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So she can succeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.58,1:05:27.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 所以 咱们一家都能成功 - 我明白你的意思 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So we can succeed! - I get it, Bob!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.05,1:05:30.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有多久没睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get it. When was the last time you slept?{\r}
