Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.85,1:05:33.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,毕竟他还只是婴儿而已嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, he's a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.42,1:05:35.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能搞定的 我自己就能搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can handle it, I got this handled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.79,1:05:37.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么说 你能搞定 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you good then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.72,1:05:40.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都尽在你掌握之中 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got everything under control? Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.96,1:05:44.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.50,1:05:47.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰宝宝 想吃饼干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cookie! Cha Cha want a cookie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.57,1:05:50.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吃的饼干 小杰宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Num-num cookie? Cha Cha wanna num-num?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.50,1:05:53.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吃的饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Num-num cookie! Cookie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.37,1:05:54.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没… - 饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not... - Cookie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.54,1:05:55.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吃的饼干 - 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God! - Cookie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.84,1:05:57.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 爸爸 - 哇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dada! Dada. Dada. - Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.65,1:06:01.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,也就是说他还能听见你 哪怕是在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, he can still hear you from the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.62,1:06:03.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,在四维空间也能听见 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the other dimension, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.65,1:06:05.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个很怪 感觉不太妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is freaky. I mean, that's not like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.75,1:06:08.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,不像我的那两个孩子 对 他就是不像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like our other kids. No, it is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.79,1:06:11.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,充满能量 随时随地都可能发动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full powers, totally random.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.49,1:06:13.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,那现在他算是 在那吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now, he's what? Is he good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.83,1:06:15.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,对呀 他看起来很好 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you'd think so, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.97,1:06:19.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是我总不能一直给他吃饼干吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously, I can't keep giving him cookies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.07,1:06:21.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 呃呃 - 要是我不给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uh-uh? - But if I stop...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.61,1:06:26.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,他又在胡闹了 又在闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahhh! He is freaking! Again, he is freaking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.61,1:06:28.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不准咬你爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No biting the daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.11,1:06:29.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么... - 不准乱咬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the...? - No biting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.05,1:06:37.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.89,1:06:41.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该只是需要一点时间做自己的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I just need a little bit of me time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.99,1:06:43.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后我就能好起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll be good to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.53,1:06:45.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可不是一点点时间的问题 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you need more than me time, Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.70,1:06:47.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要在许多方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need major life realignment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.60,1:06:48.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,调整自己的生活方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a number of levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.83,1:06:51.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先就要想办法搞定这个小怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting with baby superfreak here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.60,1:06:55.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要的是新想法 而不是这些老套路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need some solid outside-the-box thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.02,1:07:05.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,戈尔巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galbaki?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.62,1:07:09.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人的超能装居然是找戈尔巴基做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elastigirl's supersuit is by Galbaki?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.69,1:07:11.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你给我好好解释一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explain yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.19,1:07:16.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天 你怎么憔悴成这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. You're worse than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.96,1:07:20.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来找你是因为小杰的事 我把他带过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the baby. I brought the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.64,1:07:23.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,这倒是很少见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, highly unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.25,1:07:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你脸色太差了 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look ghastly, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.05,1:07:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都没怎么睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't been sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.22,1:07:38.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我伤了女儿的心 也不会做新数学题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I broke my daughter, they keep changing math...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.92,1:07:41.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,学校要带五号电池 可我买成了二号电池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we needed double-A batteries, but I got triple-A's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.99,1:07:44.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在还是没有五号电池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now we still need double-A batteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.93,1:07:47.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我把红衣服和白衣服放在一起洗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put one red thing in a load of whites{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.23,1:07:49.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果都洗成了粉色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now everything's pink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.53,1:07:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们家鸡蛋也快没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I think we need eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.80,1:07:54.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要能把孩子养好 也是非常伟大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done properly, parenting is a heroic act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.57,1:07:56.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,前提是养得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done properly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.07,1:07:59.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 这个问题从来都没有困扰过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am fortunate that it has never afflicted me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.24,1:08:00.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来我这 不是为了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you do not come to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.94,1:08:03.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,要鸡蛋和电池的吧 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for eggs and batteries, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.58,1:08:04.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是设计超能装的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I design herowear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.98,1:08:07.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人必须换一件新超能服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Elastigirl must have a new suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.65,1:08:10.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来这是为了小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, it's Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.25,1:08:13.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想给小婴儿也做一件超能装么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You also wish a new suit for the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.09,1:08:17.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在他还小 应该没那么急着穿超能服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would hardly classify this as an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.13,1:08:19.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,他这个是特殊情况 很值得研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's a special case. Worth studying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.90,1:08:22.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能不能把他放在你这一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could just leave him with you for a while...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.00,1:08:23.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说把他放在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him? Here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.93,1:08:27.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这人可不喜欢带孩子 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not a baby person, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.07,1:08:30.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这也没有孩子用的东西 我是个艺术家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no baby facilities. I am an artist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.04,1:08:33.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我绝对不会做这种琐碎又平庸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not involve myself in the prosaic day-to-day to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.08,1:08:35.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.72,1:08:40.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.12,1:08:44.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看到了吗 鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you seeing this, Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.86,1:08:47.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.94,1:08:59.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.81,1:09:02.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.14,1:09:03.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你当然可以把小杰留在我这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you can leave the baby overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.98,1:09:05.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,何莉不在家 你做家务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure filling in for Helen is challenging,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.71,1:09:06.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,也一定也很累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you are very tired...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.91,1:09:08.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,那两个孩子也需要你照顾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the other children need you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.01,1:09:09.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们想你了 赶紧回家去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and miss you, and you must go to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.72,1:09:11.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫衣娜阿姨会照顾好小杰的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Auntie Edna will take care of everything...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.15,1:09:13.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好开车注意安全 再见 感谢你的到访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, drive safely and goodbye. I enjoy our visits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.62,1:09:18.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫衣娜 阿姨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Auntie Edna"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.80,1:09:25.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,请注意 请注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention. Attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:27.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想感谢今晚到场的所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna thank everyone that came out tonight...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.77,1:09:29.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们支持超人事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in support of superheroes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.17,1:09:32.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,让他们得以重见天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and bringing them back into society!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.77,1:09:34.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你们推动了进步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all made it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.38,1:09:35.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的社会对超人的需要之迫切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The need for this has been made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.81,1:09:37.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近尤为突出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crystal clear in recent days...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.18,1:09:39.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,有些跳梁小丑 比如那个自称屏霸的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with bad actors like the self-proclaimed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.11,1:09:41.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,威胁着社会稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screenslaver threatening our peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.28,1:09:42.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,可他没闹腾多久就完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His reign was short, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.88,1:09:44.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得这一切要感谢这位女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thanks to this woman...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.99,1:09:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,伟大的超人 你们都爱她 也都想见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a great super. You love her. You missed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.16,1:09:52.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back, Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.06,1:09:54.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,快上来 别害羞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on up here. Don't be bashful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.86,1:09:57.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 到台上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.27,1:10:00.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想把这个送给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to have this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.07,1:10:01.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,做个纪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A memento.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.84,1:10:05.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢温斯顿 伊芙琳 还有迪沃科技的全体员工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Winston, Evelyn, and everyone at DEVTECH.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.21,1:10:07.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我永远感谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am forever in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.21,1:10:08.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,也感谢到场的各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thanks to all of you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.95,1:10:12.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你们的支持改变了大家对超人的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your pressure changed all the right minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.05,1:10:14.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在很短时间内取得了非常大的进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've made amazing headway in a very short time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.35,1:10:17.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我现在要宣布一个重要消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which leads me to an important announcement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.82,1:10:20.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在刚才的一场世界级的峰会上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just now, at a worldwide summit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.02,1:10:21.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,超过一百个国家的领导人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leaders from more than a hundred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.93,1:10:23.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经达成了共识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the world's top countries...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.69,1:10:27.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,致力于推动超能力的合法化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have agreed to make superheroes legal again!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.03,1:10:30.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll gather superheroes and leaders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.83,1:10:32.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界各地的领导人和超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from all over the planet...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.04,1:10:33.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,来到我们的正义号轮船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on our boat, the Everjust...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.84,1:10:37.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,参加国际协定的签署仪式 全程通过直播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a televised signing ceremony at sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.21,1:10:41.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在各位别耽搁了 大家赶快上船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now if you'll excuse us, we got a ship to catch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.28,1:10:46.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 谢谢你能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So good to see you. Thanks for coming out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.68,1:10:48.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 我又来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hi, it's me, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.69,1:10:51.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个 我一直想问你个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, there's, uh, something I've always wanted to ask you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.82,1:10:54.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是怎么平衡超人工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, how do you balance the superhero stuff{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.39,1:10:56.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,和日常生活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the life stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.19,1:10:58.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能处理好超人的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I can handle the superhero stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.74,1:11:04.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我有事要稍微离开一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you please excuse me a moment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.74,1:11:07.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的 那一会再聊 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Yeah, okay, see you later! Good talk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.03,1:11:31.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 小倩 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Vi. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.40,1:11:33.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰怎么没回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.87,1:11:35.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,莫衣娜夫人会照顾他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}E's taking him for a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.07,1:11:37.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 莫衣娜会看孩子么 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Edna is babysitting? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.84,1:11:39.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你就把小杰留给他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're okay with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.91,1:11:42.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 我也不知道为什么但我就这么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I don't know why, but yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.25,1:11:46.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有些话想跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to say something to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.98,1:11:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,托尼的事 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about Tony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.39,1:11:53.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没想到迪瑞克会抹掉托尼的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think about Dicker erasing his memory...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.36,1:11:57.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,也没想到 你要为你自己从没做过的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or about you having to pay the price for a choice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.03,1:12:00.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,付出代价 这不公平 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you never made. It's not fair, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.96,1:12:03.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,后来在餐馆里 我又雪上加霜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, I made it worse at the restaurant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.03,1:12:04.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,让你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by trying to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.50,1:12:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正 不管怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway. Anyway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.50,1:12:08.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.37,1:12:09.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,过去我一直很确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm used to knowing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.94,1:12:11.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,自己做的事情是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what the right thing to do is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.84,1:12:15.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,可现在我说不好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but now, I'm not sure anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.01,1:12:17.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想当一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.35,1:12:20.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,好爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a good dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.52,1:12:26.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是一般的好爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.83,1:12:30.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,是超级好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're super.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.04,1:12:43.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,超人在工作的时候允许喝一点酒吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are superheroes allowed to drink on duty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.01,1:12:46.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在绝对不是在工作 虽然穿着制服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm definitely not on duty. Ignore the costume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.14,1:12:48.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我应该上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I should be up there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.28,1:12:50.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过总和人微笑握手我有些累了 我想清静一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I had to step away from the grip and grins, you know?{\r}
