Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.39,1:16:45.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不天啊 他在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Lord! What is he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.43,1:16:48.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是听到了莫扎特的音乐就分身的 鲍勃 这可没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's Mozart, Robert. Can you blame him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.50,1:16:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,重要的是衣服上的传感器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The important thing is that the suit and tracker...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.80,1:16:53.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以预测他要分身 并且提醒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anticipated the change and alerted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.11,1:16:54.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. Cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.21,1:16:55.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得回去拿饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get cookies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.71,1:16:57.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全不需要饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do not need cookies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.68,1:16:58.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我昨晚已经得到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I learned quite painfully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.81,1:17:00.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,沉痛的教训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}last night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.15,1:17:01.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果想通过给他饼干解决问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any solution involving cookies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.72,1:17:04.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后都会让他变成恶魔宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will inevitably result in the demon baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.69,1:17:08.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,即将爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Combustion imminent"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.22,1:17:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.36,1:17:12.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是要着火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means fire, Robert,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.13,1:17:14.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过超能装置有微型的灭火设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for which the suit has countermeasures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.36,1:17:17.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我建议你赶紧把这孩子身上的火灭掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you extinguish the baby's flames{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.23,1:17:19.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后我屋里的烟雾警报器就要响了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before he trips the sprinkler system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.27,1:17:23.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我用的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The flame retardant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.10,1:17:25.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,黑莓薰衣草味的阻燃剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is blackberry lavender, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.31,1:17:28.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,见效快 可食用 而且非常美味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Effective, edible, and delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.21,1:17:31.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,大开眼界 这个还真是管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what do you know? That is useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.48,1:17:34.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我的作品远远的超过了你的预期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, I have doubtlessly exceeded your expectations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.38,1:17:36.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且只用了一个晚上的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a single night's work...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.39,1:17:37.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这套衣服还是有几点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the suit and device contain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.69,1:17:39.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,需要我们进一步讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a few more features we need to discuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.89,1:17:42.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 莫衣娜 谢谢你做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks again, E, for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.49,1:17:44.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该你给你多少钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do I owe you for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.23,1:17:47.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你别来这套 只要保证我是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pish-posh, darling. Your bill will be covered by my fee...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.20,1:17:49.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,超能先生 弹力女超人 和破冰侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for being Mr. Incredible, Elastigirl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.30,1:17:51.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,在全宇宙范围里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Frozone's exclusive designer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.70,1:17:54.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,唯一个超能装设计师 期限是永远永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throughout the known universe and until the end of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.37,1:17:56.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,至于照顾这个小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But babysitting this one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.41,1:17:59.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我分文不取 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do for free, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.86,1:18:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would resist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.20,1:18:19.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,就不会随意乱动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the temptation to stretch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.50,1:18:22.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里的气温比冰点还要低很多度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The temperature around you is well below freezing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.60,1:18:25.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你乱动的话 胳膊会断的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to stretch and you'll break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.37,1:18:28.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么看来你才是真的屏霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're the Screenslaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.17,1:18:30.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,也是 也不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes and no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.51,1:18:33.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该是说我创造了这个形象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's say, I created the character{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.31,1:18:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你提前录下了他要说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pre-recorded the messages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.21,1:18:36.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你哥哥知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does Winston know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.58,1:18:39.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你问他知道我是屏霸吗 他当然不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I'm the Screenslaver? Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.52,1:18:41.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要是拿到了我的催眠技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you imagine what Mr. Free Enterprise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.95,1:18:43.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了盈利还不知道要做出什么事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would do with my hypnosis technology?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.76,1:18:45.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要做的事 难道会比你做的更坏么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worse than what you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.42,1:18:47.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是在利用技术来破除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm using the technology{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.56,1:18:49.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们对技术的迷信和过度依赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to destroy people's trust in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.40,1:18:51.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像我利用超人们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I'm using superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.83,1:18:53.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我抓住的那个人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who did I put in jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.40,1:18:54.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是个送披萨的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pizza delivery guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.67,1:18:56.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的身高体重很合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seemed the right height, build.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.47,1:18:58.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,他让你好好的表演了一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave you a pretty good fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.77,1:19:00.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该说是我通过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should say I gave you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.37,1:19:01.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,让你好好的表演了一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a pretty good fight through him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.74,1:19:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个无辜的人进了监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it doesn't bother you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.51,1:19:05.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也不在乎吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that an innocent man is in jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.41,1:19:08.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的态度很差的 披萨都凉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eh, he was surly and the pizza was cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.65,1:19:10.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来很信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I counted on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.38,1:19:11.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你才失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.82,1:19:13.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.39,1:19:15.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要信任我呢 因为我给了你摩托车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you count on me? Because I built you a bike?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.92,1:19:18.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我哥哥正好会唱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because my brother knows the words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.43,1:19:19.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹力女超人的那首主题曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to your theme song?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.53,1:19:21.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们谁也不了解谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.26,1:19:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是你仍然可以信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can count on me anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.87,1:19:24.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该信任你对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am supposed to, aren't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.63,1:19:27.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你有奇怪的超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you have some strange abilities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.24,1:19:28.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,还穿着闪亮的超能装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a shiny costume...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.47,1:19:30.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们这些人就应该无条件的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rest of us are supposed to put our lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.91,1:19:32.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,把性命交到你双手里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into your gloved hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.94,1:19:35.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲就是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what my father believed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.48,1:19:39.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,有强盗想闯进我们家里的时候 我妈妈想藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When our home was broken into, my mother wanted to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.25,1:19:41.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我劝我父亲去安全屋里躲躲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Begged my father to use the safe room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.55,1:19:45.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,但父亲坚持要给那些超人朋友打电话求助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Father insisted they call his superhero friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.96,1:19:50.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果死了 死的毫无意义 而且愚蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died, pointlessly, stupidly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.76,1:19:53.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,临死前还在等着超人来拯救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}waiting for heroes to save the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.43,1:19:54.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why would you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.83,1:19:56.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你哥哥 - 他就是个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your brother... - Is a child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.03,1:19:58.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,他记得以前那个时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He remembers the time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.70,1:20:00.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有父母 而且有超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we had parents and superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.84,1:20:04.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,于是他就像个孩子一样 搞不清两者的区别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, like a child, Winston conflates the two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.78,1:20:08.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈和爸爸丧生了 一定是因为超人离开导致的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy and Daddy went away because supers went away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.55,1:20:11.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我善良的父母真是傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our sweet parents were fools{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.32,1:20:13.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,把自己的性命交到了一个超人的手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to put their lives in anybody else's hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.42,1:20:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,有了超人我们反而更软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superheroes keep us weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.32,1:20:17.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想要杀了我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.76,1:20:19.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.79,1:20:23.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,利用你更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Using you is better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.33,1:20:26.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以帮助我让超人们永远不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna help me make supers illegal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.33,1:20:27.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,重见天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.81,1:20:34.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dada. Dada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.34,1:20:37.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了吗 激光眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready? Laser eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.95,1:20:40.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.01,1:20:41.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 好酷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wow! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.45,1:20:42.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 穿上这个 - 很棒 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yay, Jack-Jack! - Yeah, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.72,1:20:43.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's not all. Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.98,1:20:45.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰 激光眼准备好了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack-Jack, blaster ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.52,1:20:52.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 这真是太酷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No way. - That is crazy cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.63,1:20:53.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来 让我先用他开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My turn. I get to blast him first!{\r}
