Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.76,1:20:58.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,在咱们家里不许让宝宝随意开火 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No firing the baby around the house, you understand?{\r}
