Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.49,1:21:26.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的出来吧 好吃的饼干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Come out. Num-num cookie?{\r}
