Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.38,1:21:44.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,来迪沃科技的船上找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet me on our ship at DEVTECH.{\r}
