Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.98,1:21:49.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,迪沃科技的船 什么事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's at the ship at DEVTECH?{\r}
