Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.73,1:25:11.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,行为就有些奇怪了 她在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she's acting kind of strange. In here.{\r}
