Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.35,1:27:01.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,船开走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, we missed 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.45,1:27:06.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是超能跑车能帮我追上那艘船就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I wish the Incredibile could follow that boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.76,1:27:10.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你干了什么 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you do? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.29,1:27:13.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你到底干了什么 - 我什么都没干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you do? - I didn't do anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.90,1:27:24.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说什么这车就做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, this car does anything I say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.78,1:27:33.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在情况可不太妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't plan this well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.52,1:27:35.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会 我们都到这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean? We're here, aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.19,1:27:36.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 我们是在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.79,1:27:39.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我们需要去的是上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to be up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.16,1:27:41.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.33,1:27:45.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,这辆超能跑车会不会正好配备了弹射座椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if the Incredibile has ejector seats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.80,1:27:47.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢着 什么 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.20,1:27:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 不 别再乱说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, baby! - No, don't say any more...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.93,1:27:50.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,最大功率 发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Max power! Launch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.88,1:27:59.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.38,1:28:04.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们好 很高兴你们能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello! Glad you could come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.05,1:28:06.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来参加仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the conference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.36,1:28:18.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的主角们都去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our stars, where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.16,1:28:19.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,仪式就要开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The event's about to start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.47,1:28:21.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不想抢了其他人的风头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They didn't want to upstage the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.50,1:28:24.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,签字仪式开始后 他们会来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll join for the signing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.00,1:28:26.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎登船今天我们有特别节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, guests! You're in for a treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.51,1:28:31.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的正义号是整地球上最大的一艘水翼船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ship is the largest hydrofoil on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.14,1:28:32.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以大家要抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, hold onto something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.28,1:28:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我们马上就要出发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we're going to open her up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.27,1:28:55.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到妈妈和爸爸 你待在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find Mom and Dad. Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.94,1:28:57.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我出去找他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna search for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.14,1:28:59.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢着 不是你看着小杰吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Who's gonna watch Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.58,1:29:01.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,别废话了 我很快就回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suck it up. I won't be long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.61,1:29:04.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等…等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Wait, but, but wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.28,1:29:07.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着巴小飞 爸爸妈妈有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is important. They are in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.08,1:29:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,全靠我们了 靠我们了 你能明白吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's up to us. To us, understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.02,1:29:12.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,赶紧好好哄哄他 安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep him amused but quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.97,1:29:27.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘘 安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh! Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.31,1:29:34.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.15,1:29:46.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰 小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack-Jack? Jack-Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.46,1:30:20.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack-Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.33,1:30:22.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,那几个超人不知道我们在这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mesmerized supers know we're here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.23,1:30:25.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我找到了爸爸妈妈 小杰去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I found Mom and Dad... Where's Jack-Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.20,1:30:28.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把他丢了 我就让你干这么一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost him? I gave you one thing to do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.37,1:30:30.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有办法 有追踪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tracker. Use the tracker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.04,1:30:35.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在往上走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's going up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.24,1:30:37.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他是在电梯里 - 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's in an elevator. - Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.35,1:30:42.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿小朋友 你爸妈在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, little baby. Where are your parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.55,1:30:46.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位 他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here they are, folks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.52,1:30:49.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是他们让这一切变为可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The supers who started this whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.42,1:30:51.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说过了他们会准时到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you they'd be there in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.43,1:30:54.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你给他们做新面具了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, did you make them new masks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.13,1:30:56.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 夜视功能什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Night vision, et cetera...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.10,1:30:57.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好看 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They look good, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.47,1:30:59.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,很简单的 他都会做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So simple, even he can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.24,1:31:03.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备直播 倒计时 三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're back live in three, two, one...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.24,1:31:05.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是一个历史性的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a momentous occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.01,1:31:06.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们今天所要完成的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've all managed to accomplish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.64,1:31:10.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,当今世界上一项罕见的壮举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something extraordinarily rare in today's world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.15,1:31:12.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是我们达成了共识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We agree on something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.08,1:31:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,要撤销一个错误的决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We agree to undo a bad decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.19,1:31:19.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,要让来自\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To make sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.49,1:31:21.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,世界各国的少数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a few extraordinarily gifted members...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.39,1:31:24.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,超能力拥有者在社会上得到公平对待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the world's many countries are treated fairly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.19,1:31:27.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还要邀请他们用自己的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To invite them once again to use their gifts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.56,1:31:29.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,造福世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to benefit the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.07,1:31:30.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要感谢到场的所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thank all of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.57,1:31:33.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们代表了各个国家对超人的支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for representing your nation's commitment to superheroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.44,1:31:36.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我特别要感谢塞立克大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With special thanks to Ambassador Selick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.01,1:31:37.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,对 没关系 尽情鼓掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's okay. Let her hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.71,1:31:39.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.18,1:31:40.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢您 大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Ambassador,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.48,1:31:42.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,您的支持来的最早也非常关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for your early and very crucial support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.61,1:31:45.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,恐怕没有任何一个人比您更适合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't think of anyone more deserving than you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.35,1:31:47.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一个在国际超人协定上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be the first signature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.19,1:31:50.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,签上自己的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the International Superhero Accord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.36,1:31:53.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我签好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.17,1:32:09.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy cow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.08,1:32:11.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道是着火了 赶快给我灭掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he's on fire. Just put him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.08,1:32:20.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.30,1:32:30.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,把遥控器给他没事么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it okay to give him that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.76,1:32:33.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道你还有什么别的好办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't hearing any better ideas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.79,1:32:59.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.53,1:33:01.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,快来 小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.26,1:33:02.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.53,1:33:03.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,要吃饼干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cookie num-num?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.28,1:33:19.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 妈妈 - 我看到他了 他跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mama, Mama. - I see him. He's getting away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.12,1:33:20.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.32,1:33:26.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 丫的 - 他是去找妈妈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Darn it! - He's heading for Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.86,1:33:32.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,签署完成了 超人得以重见天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is done. The world is super again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.57,1:33:40.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,来合个影 来吧 大家来合影了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Group photo. Come on. Group photo, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.24,1:33:43.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,站近一点 历史性的一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squeeze in. That's it. Historic occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.17,1:33:44.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,呵呵 大家笑一笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.32,1:33:53.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,开始第二步行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on phase two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.29,1:33:55.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,多年来我们遭到压迫 如同过街老鼠般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years of mandated hiding and silence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.69,1:33:57.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这使得我们超人群体对社会充满愤恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have made us bitter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.32,1:33:59.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们现在让我们重见天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bring us out into the light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.19,1:34:00.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是你们缺乏自制力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only to clean up the messes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.49,1:34:02.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,无法解决自己造成的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your lack of discipline creates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.56,1:34:05.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的身体和精神都太过软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your bodies and your character are weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.20,1:34:08.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的承诺都是空谈 你们会为此付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your promises are empty, and you will pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.87,1:34:10.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不在为你们而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We no longer serve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.74,1:34:12.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只为自己而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We serve only us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.34,1:34:14.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有强大才能生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the fittest survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.74,1:34:17.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.78,1:34:20.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来直播出现了一些情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some very alarming moments there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.55,1:34:23.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能是有些技术问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the, uh, technical difficulties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.35,1:34:24.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,请不要走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please bear with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.77,1:34:39.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,设呢么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.43,1:34:40.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,求救 求救 求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mayday! Mayday! Mayday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.94,1:34:42.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下 让他说完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold! Let him talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.50,1:34:44.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,有超人闯进来占领了驾驶舱 重复一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superheroes have forcibly taken the bridge. Repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.51,1:34:45.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,重复一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.69,1:34:58.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,再转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.29,1:35:00.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,再转 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little further. Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.90,1:35:08.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么情况 一个宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the... A baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.46,1:35:10.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈 鲁修斯叔叔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom and Dad. Uncle Lucius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.94,1:35:14.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 妈妈 - 小杰 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My mama. - Jack-Jack, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.71,1:35:19.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,有超能力的宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A super baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.38,1:35:25.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.82,1:35:26.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,快把他放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.62,1:35:30.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抓住她 - 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Grab her! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.29,1:35:31.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱着小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.66,1:35:41.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.60,1:35:43.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.47,1:35:44.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,上次我也是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's what I thought last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.87,1:35:47.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们 你们怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids, what are you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.38,1:35:51.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来救我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.98,1:35:53.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,别生我们的气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.35,1:35:55.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊 好孩子 我怎么可能生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sweetie, how could I be mad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.72,1:35:59.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是很骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.02,1:36:00.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不是想打扰你们温馨的团聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to break up a tender moment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.89,1:36:02.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我们这是在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.39,1:36:03.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是迪沃科技的船吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this DEVTECH's ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.86,1:36:05.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,是伊芙琳那个家伙创造了屏霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evelyn Deavor controls the Screenslaver...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.86,1:36:08.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且刚才她还控制了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and until a second ago, us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.66,1:36:10.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,船员在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the crew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.73,1:36:12.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,碰撞即将发生 请调整航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Collision detected. Correct course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.93,1:36:14.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我干的么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh. Did I do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.33,1:36:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈 你的超能服 换上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, the suit? Try this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.74,1:36:22.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,第三步 现在执行第三步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phase Three. Go on Phase Three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.58,1:36:27.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们怎么在这 你难道没去我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are the kids here? You didn't go to the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.95,1:36:29.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去了你家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.35,1:36:30.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们没逃走吗 你们怎么没逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't escape? How did you not escape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.72,1:36:32.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 我们刚救了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! We just saved you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.92,1:36:34.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,逃走 谁在逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Escape? Escape from who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.89,1:36:38.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.63,1:36:44.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰居然有超能力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...? Jack-Jack has powers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.37,1:36:46.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然了 打完了再跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know. Fight now, talk later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.67,1:37:21.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.41,1:37:22.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,激光眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laser eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.57,1:37:52.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,快跟我来 温斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me, Winston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.61,1:37:54.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的头好晕啊 - 你在这很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did I faint? - You'll be safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.57,1:37:56.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全 这里怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safe? Safe from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.68,1:37:59.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些外交官们呢 超…超人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the diplomats? The supers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.95,1:38:01.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,还在催眠呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still hypnotized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.08,1:38:03.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你都干了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.72,1:38:09.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,伊芙琳逃走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evelyn, she's escaping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.92,1:38:10.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就…快去追她啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, go after her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.96,1:38:11.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,完成你的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finish your mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.76,1:38:14.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能就这么走了 孩子怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't just go! What about the kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.46,1:38:17.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小杰呢 谁来照顾 - 妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jack-Jack, who's gonna... - Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.07,1:38:18.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去 我们能搞定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. We've got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.70,1:38:22.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,穿越侠 你跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Voyd, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.60,1:38:24.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去关闭发动机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go shut down the engine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.01,1:38:25.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去船头想办法让船减速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll try to slow the ship from the bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.67,1:38:28.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢着 有个人不见了 那个挤压东西的家伙去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, someone's missing. Where's the crusher guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.61,1:38:30.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,系上安全带 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strap in now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.83,1:38:47.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这是为了你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for your own good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.80,1:38:49.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.50,1:38:50.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.91,1:39:04.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们太迟了 - 送我上飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're too late. - Get me up to the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.51,1:39:31.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 这是你干的 你能把这些复原吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you did this. Can you undo it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.24,1:39:33.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想让我反碾压一下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to un-crush?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.58,1:39:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么 没人这么要求过我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No one's ever asked for that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.21,1:39:38.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有 反碾压太傻了 干嘛要反碾压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. To un-crush is silly. Why un-crush?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.22,1:39:39.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要进引擎室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To get into the engine room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.82,1:39:41.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 算了 已经没有时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, forget it. We don't have enough time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.05,1:39:43.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你能反打一下左勾拳吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I said to un-punch someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.62,1:39:44.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,这根本没法打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.53,1:39:50.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎登机 弹力女超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome aboard, Elastigirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.06,1:39:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我们现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although we haven't yet reached{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.76,1:39:53.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,还没有达到巡航高度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our cruising altitude...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.63,1:39:57.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以在机舱内自由活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feel free to roam about the cabin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.00,1:39:59.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者你放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or just relax...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.67,1:40:02.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,让机舱在你身边翻滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and let the cabin roam about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.59,1:40:13.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我进不了引擎室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get to the engine room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.59,1:40:14.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们总得想出个办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.99,1:40:16.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为船已经不能减速了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because trying to slow it down ain't working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.66,1:40:18.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们让船转向呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! What about turning the boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.59,1:40:19.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,船的方向杆已经毁掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The steering's been destroyed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.79,1:40:22.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小飞是说 从外面转弯 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dash means from the outside! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.60,1:40:23.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,要折断水翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we break off one of the foils{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.70,1:40:24.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,再使劲转动船舵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and turn the rudder...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.87,1:40:27.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,正义号就不会撞上岸边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can veer the ship away from the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.24,1:40:28.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,这办法也许有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That might work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.70,1:40:29.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去推船头 你去推船尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll turn the front, you turn the rear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.84,1:40:31.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,转动船舵 那可是在水下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Using the rudder? That's underwater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.94,1:40:33.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我又怎么才能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I supposed to get...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.21,1:40:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 跟我过来孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Come on, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.11,1:40:38.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 我知道这办法能成功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, I know this is going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.15,1:40:40.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是万一不成功 船撞上岸边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it doesn't, and we crash...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.68,1:40:44.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的防护罩比船体更坚固\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my shields are probably better protection than the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.09,1:40:47.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我应该留在这 保护好小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should stay here. With Jack-Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.29,1:40:49.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不愧是我女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.79,1:40:52.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,记住了 鲍勃 我们两个都往右转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember, Bob, we're both turning right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.90,1:41:00.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还挺难过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what's sad?{\r}
