Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.65,1:41:19.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我们还没有收到相应的视频信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While there is still no radio contact,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.79,1:41:21.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,正义号已经转向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the ship has changed direction...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.33,1:41:22.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,用最快的速度朝着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is heading towards land{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.63,1:41:24.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,城市海岸行驶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a high rate of speed.{\r}
