Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.71,1:41:37.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好的 爸爸 - 现在放我下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, Dad. - Now lower me down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.81,1:41:45.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们超人的好名声 已经毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reputations of superheroes are ruined.{\r}
