Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.93,1:41:57.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,连一点点机会都没有么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even a little smidgee-widgee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.23,1:41:58.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你缺氧了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hypoxia.{\r}
