Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.08,1:42:42.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人 请你们马上到船尾去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, we need to get to the back of the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.18,1:42:44.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有超人 保护好大使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All supers, protect your ambassadors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.75,1:42:47.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,走这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow.{\r}
