Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.37,1:45:18.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们站下一班岗 我去休息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys got the next shift. I'm beat. Oh!{\r}
