Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.21,1:46:27.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是很尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is embarrassing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.28,1:46:28.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很帅气吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charmed, I'm sure.{\r}
