Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.18,1:46:55.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是的 是这样 - 也许你能加入我们大家一起更亲密呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I guess. - We can get closer.{\r}
